The said Bank shall have power:
(a) To ascept deposits;
(b) To make loans;
(c) To engage in exchange and other banking operations;
(a) To adopt and use a seal;
(e) To make contracts;
(f) To sue and be sued;
(a) To exercise the powers sranted herein and such incidental
powers as may be necessary to transact the business of banking.
DEPOSITS AND WITHDRAMAIS
The Bank is hereby authorized to receive deposits and may
pay interest thereon, from the Commonwealth of the Philippines, the
provinces, municipalities, Fostal Savings Bank, firms, companies,
corporations, private persons, allied governments, their departments,
agencies and armed forces, of demand, time and savings funds, subject

- 2 -
withdrawal by check or presentation of savings bank book.
